1. Purpose

   The source code in this repository is published for transparency and
   security review. It corresponds to the official Linknesis Probe releases;
   each release is tagged with its version number.

2. What you may do

   a) Read and audit the source code.

   b) Compile the source code, unmodified, for example to verify that it
      corresponds to the official Linknesis Probe releases.

   c) Run Probe binaries that you compiled from this repository, unmodified,
      with a Linknesis Core licensed to you, under the same terms that apply
      to the official Probe binaries.

   d) Report security issues and, after responsible disclosure as described
      in SECURITY.md, publish your findings.

